    // To do this efficiently, we try all intervals that include startPos or are reachable.

    // We try two strategies:
    // 1) Go left first, then right:
    //    Steps = startPos - leftPos + (rightPos - leftPos)
    // 2) Go right first, then left:
    //    Steps = rightPos - startPos + (rightPos - leftPos)

